				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t01r0401_black_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チェレン『……アララギはかせ？
